# Git commit attribution

When creating commits or pull requests:

- Do not add `Co-authored-by:` trailers.
- Do not add `Made-with: Cursor` or similar attribution footers.
- Do not use `git commit --trailer`.
- Use plain commits only, e.g. `git commit -m "message"`.
